{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Death Mountain</i></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723830/extras/3026d424c96e3ad48c0794c9284e4178.avif?t=1766658685\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you\u2019ll follow the perspective of May, a battlefield nurse trapped in a medical camp deep within a snowbound mountain range on the brink of collapse. <br>In the desperate cold and dwindling supplies, a mysterious letter presented by a prisoner of war becomes the last thread of hope for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this path to survival, former enemies may become allies, and trusted friends may harbor secrets. <br>You\u2019ll need to gather information to gradually uncover each character\u2019s past and inner thoughts. <br>Your choices will shape the fates of everyone involved.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A 2D adventure game focused on map exploration and narrative puzzles. <br>\u25cf Investigate items scattered across the map and converse with those around you. <br>\u25cf The clues you uncover will be added to each character\u2019s profile, slowly revealing the truth behind their relationships and past events. <br>\u25cf If you wish to unravel the mountain\u2019s dark secrets, talk more with those around you\u2014 <br>after all, they may know far more than they\u2019re willing to say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Art Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf The game combines traditional 2D hand-drawn art with pixel-style graphics. <br>\u25cf Chibi characters move through flat maps, offering a distinct experience from the character portraits. <br>\u25cf Our team has hidden various material elements as Easter eggs within CG cutscenes. <br>Every decision you make may unlock different visual styles\u2014feel free to explore and discover them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723830/extras/ada188a5e0c6f86a47a6a5946c6bc847.avif?t=1766658685\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723830/extras/2a55b7149fe32c6788fb6c75a8bc933d.avif?t=1766658685\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Name:</strong> May <br><strong>Age:</strong> 19 <br><strong>Role:</strong> Battlefield Nurse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723830/extras/5ea8b104f1ba095a44d52e83f3d389eb.avif?t=1766658685\" width=1600 height=1072 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Name:</strong> Solia <br><strong>Age:</strong> 16 (self-proclaimed) <br><strong>Role:</strong> Battlefield Nurse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723830/extras/30e8d5ea875ca6380f67aaa714de4380.avif?t=1766658685\" width=1600 height=1072 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Name:</strong> Andre <br><strong>Age:</strong> 17 <br><strong>Role:</strong> Captured Youth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723830/extras/f343db52801317c7ca745902cca140e3.avif?t=1766658685\" width=1600 height=1072 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Name:</strong> Edmond <br><strong>Age:</strong> ?? <br><strong>Role:</strong> Deranged Soldier</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723830/extras/cba0e93d1c81805eb5b6a5847e93346d.avif?t=1766658685\" width=1600 height=1072 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723830?t=1766658685","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723830/8d158a9cacbfa7963ebeb59016e4e99e55874e12/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766658685","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723830/e469bc2375dd169ed9d23ba43644ce2b6856d7b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766658685","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723830/e469bc2375dd169ed9d23ba43644ce2b6856d7b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766658685","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game contains occasional suggestive language and mild depictions of violence in a narrative context. These elements are not the focus of the story and are presented in a non-explicit and non-promotional manner."},"demos":[{"appid":3840710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Death Mountain</i></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723830/extras/3026d424c96e3ad48c0794c9284e4178.avif?t=1766658685\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you\u2019ll follow the perspective of May, a battlefield nurse trapped in a medical camp deep within a snowbound mountain range on the brink of collapse. <br>In the desperate cold and dwindling supplies, a mysterious letter presented by a prisone